<title>SWEDEN: Ericsson says cash flow sufficient for investments.</title>
<headline>Ericsson says cash flow sufficient for investments.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-02-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish telecoms groups LM AB Ericsson said on Tuesday that its own cash flow should be sufficient for investment programme needs.</p>
<p>In its 1996 earnings reports, Ericsson said its cash flow before financial activities in 1996 was 4.04 billion crowns compared to a negative 2.51 billion crowns in 1995.</p>
</text>
